	(text_box "Long words:\n[FI] Lentokonesuihkuturbiinimoottoriapumekaanikkoaliupseerioppilas\n[EN] \"Airplane jet turbine engine auxiliary mechanic non-commissioned officer student\" (an old military training rank).\n\n[RU] Тетрагидропиранилциклопентилтетрагидропиридопиридиновые\n[EN] Tetrahydropyranylcyclopentyltetrahydropyridopyridine (class of organic compounds)\n\n[PL] Dziewięćsetdziewięćdziesięciodziewięcionarodowościowego\n[EN] Genitive singular form of \"of nine-hundred-and-ninety-nine nationalities.\"\n\n[DE] Rinderkennzeichnungsfleischetikettierungsüberwachungsaufgabenübertragungsgesetz\n[EN] \"Law on the delegation of duties for the supervision of cattle identification and beef labeling.\"\n\n[JP] 虎が人を噛もうとするときのうなり声\n[EN] \"The growl a tiger makes when it's about to bite a person.\""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
